  "title": "Quenched Shandong Tofu Noodles",
  "description": "Earthy, chewy noodles tossed with sashimi-cut tofu and fresh cucumber, a lazy-sunday Shandong staple. This Buddhist‑temple‑friendly dish marries oil, soy, and vinegar for a satisfying, plant‑based meal.",
