  "instructions": [
    "Bring a pot of water to a boil, add rice noodles, cook 3 minutes, then drain and set aside.",
    "Warm a wok over medium heat, add vegetable oil until shimmering.",
    "Add minced garlic to the wok, sauté 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Add pre-cooked noodles to the wok, toss with garlic for 1 minute.",
    "Gently stir in the sliced tofu, cook for 2 minutes, ensuring not to break the slices.",
    "Pour in soy sauce and rice vinegar, stir to coat noodles evenly.",
    "Remove from heat, drizzle sesame oil, and season with black pepper.",
    "Transfer to a serving dish, top with sliced cucumber and scallion, and serve immediately."
